    "title": "Bitcoin Lender Ledn Moves US Clients Onshore With New Custody Accounts",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/ledn-launches-us-custody-accounts",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Bitcoin-Backed-Loans-Could-Hit-1-Trillion-Ledn-Says-—-But-Most-Crypto-Holders-Still-Havent-Borrowed.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/ledn-launches-us-custody-accounts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Lender Ledn Moves US Clients Onshore With New Custody Accounts</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin lender Ledn launched a US custody account that lets clients hold bitcoin, gold, stablecoins and dollars, with no trading fees and a 0.5% spread.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/ledn-launches-us-custody-accounts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Lender Ledn Moves US Clients Onshore With New Custody Accounts</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
