    "title": "Anchorage Digital Sets Up Asset Manager to Offer Bitcoin Yield to Clients",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/anchorage-digital-bitcoin-yield-asset-manager",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Anchorage-Digital-Sets-Up-Asset-Manager-to-Offer-Bitcoin-Yield-to-Clients.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/anchorage-digital-bitcoin-yield-asset-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">Anchorage Digital Sets Up Asset Manager to Offer Bitcoin Yield to Clients</a></p>\n<p>Anchorage Digital is launching 61st Parallel Asset Management, a subsidiary expected to open by early December with a bitcoin-denominated fund that lets custody clients earn yield.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/anchorage-digital-bitcoin-yield-asset-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">Anchorage Digital Sets Up Asset Manager to Offer Bitcoin Yield to Clients</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
